From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 00:57:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?wasm:=20fs=20shim=20integration=20=E2=80=94=20p?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ath=5Fexists,=20ReadDir=20stream,=20no=20lockfile?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- tools::path_exists(): sync Path::exists() always returns false on wasm
  (std::fs unsupported); route through the fs shim's in-memory table
- accounts: reuse the iOS no-lockfile cfg for wasm (fd-lock unavailable;
  Config::sync() no longer demands the lock task)
- tools/blob: ReadDirStream sites cfg'd (shim ReadDir implements Stream)
- imex: the backup-path probe uses path_exists(); backup import/export
  itself comes with file-based IMEX
---
 src/accounts.rs | 21 +++++++++++----------
 src/blob.rs     |  8 +++++++-
 src/context.rs  |  2 +-
 src/imex.rs     |  6 +++---
 src/tools.rs    | 19 +++++++++++++++++--
 5 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

